<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Activate Your Account</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f6f8;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 540px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 36px 32px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid #eef0f3;
    }
    .brand {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #0f172a;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .brand span {
      color: #2563eb;
    }
    h2 {
      color: #1e293b;
      font-size: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    p {
      color: #475569;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 8px 0;
    }
    .code-box {
      margin: 28px 0;
      text-align: center;
      background: #eff6ff;
      border: 1px dashed #bfdbfe;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 18px;
    }
    .code {
      font-size: 32px;
      letter-spacing: 6px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #2563eb;
      font-family: monospace;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 32px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #94a3b8;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="brand">Mongzo<span>.</span></div>
    <h2>Hello <%= user.name %>,</h2>
    <p>Thank you for registering with Mongzo. To activate your account and complete your signup, please use the following 4-digit activation code:</p>
    
    <div class="code-box">
      <div class="code"><%= activationCode %></div>
    </div>

    <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #64748b;">
      This verification code will expire in <strong>5 minutes</strong>.
    </p>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>If you did not request this email, please safely ignore it.</p>
      <p>&copy; 2026 Mongzo Travel & Booking. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>

